    {
      "t": "S",
      "v": "Part 1: What year did beach volleyball become an official Olympic sport?",
      "n": "QuestionText1"
    },
    {
      "s": "Spike synchronisé ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "745697_1",
      "n": "CategoryAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "",
      "t": "A",
      "n": "WrongAnswerAudio3"
    },
    {
      "s": "C'est une question en deux parties... Prêt ? ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "745698_1",
      "n": "IntroAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "745700_1",
      "n": "ChoicesAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "",
      "t": "A",
      "n": "WrongAnswerAudio2"
    },
    {
      "s": "Non! Je veux dire, c'était ennuyeux mais ensuite ils ont introduit le beach-volley !!!! ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "745705_1",
      "n": "WrongAnswerAudio1"
    },
    {
      "s": "",
      "t": "A",
      "n": "Intro2Audio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Beach volleyball became an official sport of the Summer Olympics in 1996, which (COMPLETELY coincidentally) is the same year I started regularly watching the Olympics!",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "745702_1",
      "n": "ExplanationAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "To be honest I didn’t even have a television set before 1996.  Well I DID, but it didn’t have beach volleyball on it, so it was pretty much just a fancy paperweight.",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "745703_2",
      "n": "JokeAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Part 1: What year did beach volleyball become an official Olympic Sport?   and Part 2:  What year did I first start regularly watching the Olympics?",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "745699_3",
      "n": "QuestionAudio"
    }
  ]
